  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">게<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">ᄋᅷ<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2c_OzqOHuU8?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">有<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">우-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一日<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇띧ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">란<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">나</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">老<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄅᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        u-jit-rît làn na-lāu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">揣<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">췌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">共<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">가-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">란<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">有孝<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">유ˆᄒᅷ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    chue-bo-láng ka̰-làn yû-hau\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">에-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">陪<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">붸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">坐<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">제-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">恬<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">댬-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">椅條<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">이ˆᄅᆤˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà e-pue-lì je-tiam-î-liáu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">聽<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">턀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">少年<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄉᆤ`롄ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時陣<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">시준ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">有<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">우-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">偌<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">똬-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">𠢕<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄁᅷˊ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        tiā̰-lì kông-siàu-lién&#8217;e si-jūn lì u-roa-gáu\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">食好<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">쟣호`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">食<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">쟣-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">䆀<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">빼`</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">計較<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">게`ᄀᅷ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        jiah-hò jiah-bài, bo-kè-kau\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">怨天<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">완`틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">怨地<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">완`되ˉ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">嘛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">마-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">𣍐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">曉<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄒᆤ`</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        oàn-tḭ̂ oàn-toē, ma-boe-hiàu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">手<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">츄`</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">에-</rt></ruby>가<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">牽<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">칸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">牢牢<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">ᄃᆤᄃᆤˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì’e chiù, goà e-ka̰-lì khān-tiau-tiáu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">因為<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">인ˉ위-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">시ˉ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">家後<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">게ˉᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        īn-wi-goà sī, lì&#8217;e kē-āu\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">將<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">青春<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">촁ˉ춘ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">嫁<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">게`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">린<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">兜<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄃᅷˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gùn jiōng-chiēng-chûn kè-ti-lîn-tâu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">𨘗<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">뒤`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">少年<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄉᆤ`롄ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">綴<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뒈`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">綴<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뒈`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">徦<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">老<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄅᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gùn tùi-siàu-lién tuè-lì tuè-kà-lāu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人情<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">띤졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">世事<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">세`수ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">已經<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看透透<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">콸`ᄐᅷ`ᄐᅷ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        rin-jiéng sè-sū î-kiēng-khoà̰-thàu-thau\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">有<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">우-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샬ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">比<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">較<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">重要<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뎡ᄋᆤ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    u-siâ̰-láng pî-lì khâh-tiong-yau\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一生<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">읻ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">獻<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">혠`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">予<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">허-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">린<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">兜<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄃᅷˆ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        gùn&#8217;e ît-siêng hièn-hor-lîn-tâu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">才<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">知<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">幸福<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">혱헉</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">吵吵鬧鬧<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">차ˆ차ˆᄂᅷᄂᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jiâh-jāi-hieng-hork si-châ-châ-nau-nāu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">等待<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">단ˆ태-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">轉<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">등`</rt></ruby>’킈에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時陣<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">시준ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">나</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">到<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">ᄀᅷ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        tân-thai-tǹg’khi-e si-jūn na-kau\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">에-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">讓<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뉴-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\