span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">較<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">早<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">자`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">結婚<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">곋ˆ훈ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時陣<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">시준ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">偌<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">똬-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">緣投<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">옌ᄃᅷˊ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        khoà̰-khâh-jà kiêt-hûn’e si-jūn lì roa-yen-táu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">穿好<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">촁호`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">穿<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">촁-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">䆀<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">빼`</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">無<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">計較<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">게`ᄀᅷ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        chieng-hò chieng-bài, bo-kè-kau\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">怪東<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">괘`당ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">怪西<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">괘`새ˆ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">嘛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">마-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">𣍐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">曉<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄒᆤ`</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        koài-tâng koài-sâi, ma-boe-hiàu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">심ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">에-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">永遠<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">옝ˆ완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">記<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">기`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">牢牢<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">ᄃᆤᄃᆤˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì’e sîm, goà e-yêng-oân-kì-tiau-tiáu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">因為<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">인ˉ위-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">시ˉ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">家後<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">게ˉᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        īn-wi-goà sī, lì&#8217;e kē-āu\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">將<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">青春<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">촁ˉ춘ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">嫁<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">게`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">린<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">兜<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄃᅷˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gùn jiōng-chiēng-chûn kè-ti-lîn-tâu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">𨘗<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">뒤`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">少年<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄉᆤ`롄ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">就<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">됴-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">綴<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뒈`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">綴<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뒈`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">徦<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">老<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄅᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gùn tùi-siàu-lién tio-tuè-lì tuè-kà-lāu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人情<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">띤졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">世事<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">세`수ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">嘛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">마-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">已經<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看透透<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">콸`ᄐᅷ`ᄐᅷ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        rin-jiéng sè-sū ma-î-kiēng-khoà̰-thàu-thau\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">有<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">우-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샬ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">比<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">較<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">重要<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뎡ᄋᆤ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    u-siâ̰-láng pî-lì khâh-tiong-yau\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一生<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">읻ˆ솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">獻<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">혠`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">予<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">허-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">린<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">兜<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄃᅷˆ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        gùn&#8217;e ît-siêng hièn-hor-lîn-tâu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">才<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">知<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">幸福<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">혱헉</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">吵吵鬧鬧<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">차ˆ차ˆᄂᅷᄂᅷˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jiâh-jāi-hieng-hork si-châ-châ-nau-nāu\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">等待<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">단ˆ태-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">轉<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">등`</rt></ruby>’킈에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">時陣<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">시준ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">나</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">到<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">ᄀᅷ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        tân-thai-tǹg’khi-e si-jūn na-kau\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">就<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">됴-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">讓<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">뉴-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">先<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">솅ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">走<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄌᅷ`</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        lì tio-niu-goà siēng-jàu\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">因為<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">인ˉ위-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">에-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">毋<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">음-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">甘<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">감ˆ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        īn-wi-goà e-m-kâm, khoà̰-lì\n    </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n        <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">為<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">위-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">目滓<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">빡새`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">流<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄅᅷˊ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n        wi-goà bak-sài láu\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<table class=\"wp-block-table alignleft\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;border: none;font-size: 16px\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td style=\"border: none;vertical-align: top;min-width: 5em;padding-right: 1.5em;padding-left: 0;padding-top: 0;padding-bottom: 0\">\n  <a href=\"#_ftnref1\" id=\"_ftn1\">¹</a>\n  <i>\n    <span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"bak-sài\">目滓<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.3em;left: 1.1em\">빡새`</rt></ruby></span>\n  </i> :\n</td>\n    <td style=\"border: none;padding: 0\">\n      (中) 眼淚（俗字寫作「目屎」）。<br>\n      (en) Tears.\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<div style=\"clear: both;margin-bottom: 1em\"></div>\n"
